OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition highlights memorial to
OL,4,Athose lost in WW1
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe names of men who never returned
OL,7,Ffrom World War One are at the centre of
OL,8,Fefforts to bring a little-known
OL,9,Fmemorial back into public view.
OL,11,FThe memorial, which commemorates 114
OL,12,Fmen from Eastville, is housed inside
OL,13,Fthe New Testament Church of God on
OL,14,FFishponds Road and is the focus of a
OL,15,Fnew exhibition aimed at preserving
OL,16,Ftheir memory.
OL,18,FThe names include several brothers, a
OL,19,Fformer Bristol Rovers footballer and a
OL,20,Fmerchant seaman who was lost when a
OL,21,Ftroop ship was sunk by a German
OL,22,Fsubmarine.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
