OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition highlights memorial to
OL,4,Athose lost in WW1
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I almost feel as if it's actually
OL,7,Fforgotten," said parishioner Sharon
OL,8,FFrancis, who wants people to use the
OL,9,Fexhibition to discover the stories
OL,10,Fbehind the names.
